Tech Stack
1. Programming Language:Python (Core AI/ML development)
2. Machine Learning & AI:
-Scikit-learn – Customer churn prediction (Logistic -Regression, Decision Tree, Random Forest), customer segmentation (K-Means), and model evaluation.
-SHAP (Optional but recommended) – Explainable AI to show why a customer is predicted to churn.
-NLTK (Optional) – Basic sentiment analysis of customer reviews or feedback.
3. Data Processing
Pandas – Data cleaning and manipulation
NumPy – Numerical computations
OpenPyXL / CSV – Reading datasets
4. Data Visualization
Matplotlib
Plotly (Interactive charts)
Power BI (optional for business dashboards)
5. Backend: FastAPI (Faster and more scalable)
-Responsibilities:
Load trained model
Handle API requests
Return predictions
Connect frontend with ML model
6. Frontend
--Streamlit
Features:
Upload customer data
Predict churn
View dashboards
Display recommendations
--Option 2 (For a More Professional Web App)
React.js
HTML
CSS
JavaScript
Bootstrap or Tailwind CSS

7. Database
MySQL or PostgreSQL (Store customer information and prediction history)

8. APIs (Optional)
Email API (for automated retention emails)
SMS API (for alerts)
CRM API integration (future enhancement)
9. Deployment
Git & GitHub – Version control
Render or Railway – Backend deployment
Streamlit Community Cloud – Deploy Streamlit app
Docker (optional for containerization)
